{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g-supa","type":"group","x":1500,"y":-60,"width":840,"height":2250,"color":"6","label":"Supabase (project wtouwomhgbsnwuxdudld)"},
		{"id":"g-ext","type":"group","x":2520,"y":-60,"width":520,"height":2250,"color":"2","label":"External services"},
		{"id":"g-spa","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-60,"width":600,"height":1900,"color":"5","label":"React SPA (front-end/src/pages)"},
		{"id":"g-client","type":"group","x":720,"y":-60,"width":600,"height":1900,"color":"4","label":"Client data layer"},
		{"id":"login","type":"text","text":"## /login  Login\nLogged out. Email + password.\nBack to the page you came from after login.","x":0,"y":0,"width":520,"height":150},
		{"id":"register","type":"text","text":"## /register  Register\nLogged out. Name, email, password.\nLogs straight in (email confirmation off).","x":0,"y":190,"width":520,"height":150},
		{"id":"tasks","type":"text","text":"## /  Tasks\nLogged in. All tasks, newest first.\nTick to complete, delete.","x":0,"y":380,"width":520,"height":150},
		{"id":"newtask","type":"text","text":"## /tasks/new  NewTask\nTitle, project (`?project=<id>`), due date, tags.\nCan add a new tag.","x":0,"y":570,"width":520,"height":150},
		{"id":"projects","type":"text","text":"## /projects  Projects\nProjects with progress, new-project form.\nPokemonBadge: random Pokemon sprite.","x":0,"y":760,"width":520,"height":150},
		{"id":"projectdetail","type":"text","text":"## /projects/:id  ProjectDetail\nOne project's tasks.\nDelete project (tasks are kept, project_id becomes null).","x":0,"y":950,"width":520,"height":150},
		{"id":"donate","type":"text","text":"## /donate  Donate\n$5 / $10 / $25 / $50 or custom (max $10,000).\nStripe CardElement + Donate button.\nResults: thank-you, declined message, 'Something went wrong' + Retry.","x":0,"y":1140,"width":520,"height":190},
		{"id":"mug","type":"text","text":"## DonateButton (coffee mug)\nFixed bottom-right, rendered by Layout on every logged-in page (hidden on /donate). Links to /donate.","x":0,"y":1370,"width":520,"height":130,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"guards","type":"text","text":"## Route guards and frame\n**AuthLayout** wraps /login and /register. **RequireAuth** sends logged-out users to /login. **Layout** = TopBar, ErrorBanner, page, Toast, DonateButton, BottomNav. `*` = NotFound.","x":0,"y":1540,"width":520,"height":190},
		{"id":"authctx","type":"text","text":"## AuthContext  useAuth()\n`user` (profile or null), `checking`, `register`, `logIn`, `logOut`.\nReads the saved session on startup.","x":760,"y":0,"width":520,"height":170,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"taskctx","type":"text","text":"## TaskContext  useTasks()\nprojects, tasks, tags, loading, error, toasts.\nLoads everything via db.js when the user changes; every change goes through db.js, then re-loads.\nActions: addTask, addTag, addProject, removeProject, toggle / removeTask.","x":760,"y":330,"width":520,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"dbjs","type":"text","text":"## src/data/db.js\nThe ONLY file that talks to Supabase. Lazy client; every `{ error }` becomes a thrown Error; never sends user_id.\n- register, logIn, logOut, getCurrentUser\n- listProjects, createProject, deleteProject\n- listTasks, createTask (RPC), setTaskComplete, deleteTask\n- listTags, createTag\n- createDonationIntent(amount)","x":760,"y":680,"width":520,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"pokelocal","type":"text","text":"## src/data/pokeapi.js\ngetRandomPokemon() for PokemonBadge. Separate from db.js, which is Supabase-only.","x":760,"y":1090,"width":520,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"stripejs","type":"text","text":"## Stripe.js in Donate.jsx\n`loadStripe(VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY)`, CardElement, `confirmCardPayment(client_secret)`. The card goes straight to Stripe, never to our functions.","x":760,"y":1290,"width":520,"height":170,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sauth","type":"text","text":"## Supabase Auth  /auth/v1\nEmail + password. Issues the access token (JWT, ~1 h) + refresh token, saved by supabase-js in localStorage.\nTrigger `on_auth_user_created` copies each new user into `public.users`.","x":1560,"y":0,"width":780,"height":190,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"rest","type":"text","text":"## REST API (PostgREST)  /rest/v1\nHeaders: `apikey` = publishable key, `Authorization: Bearer <JWT>`.\nRLS: `auth.uid() = user_id`. Logged out: `[]` on reads, 401 on writes.","x":1560,"y":330,"width":780,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"rpc","type":"text","text":"## RPC  create_task_with_tags(p_title, p_project_id, p_due_date, p_tag_ids)\nInserts the task and its task_tags in one transaction. SECURITY INVOKER, so RLS applies. Authenticated only.","x":1560,"y":560,"width":780,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tables","type":"text","text":"## Postgres tables (RLS on)\n- **users**: profile; can edit only `name`\n- **projects**, **tasks**, **task_tags**: own rows only; `user_id` defaults to `auth.uid()`\n- **tags**: shared; any signed-in user can read and add, nobody edits or deletes\nDeleting a project nulls `tasks.project_id`.","x":1560,"y":770,"width":780,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"fn-process","type":"text","text":"## Edge Function  process-donation\n`verify_jwt` **true**. POST `{ amount }` (integer cents, 1 to 1,000,000). User from the JWT only (never the body); 401 without a login, 400 bad amount.\nCreates a Stripe PaymentIntent (metadata.user_id) with `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`. Returns `{ client_secret }`.","x":1560,"y":1080,"width":780,"height":230,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"fn-webhook","type":"text","text":"## Edge Function  stripe-webhook\n`verify_jwt` **false** (Stripe has no Supabase login). Verifies the Stripe signature on the raw body with `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (400 if bad).\nHandles `payment_intent.succeeded` / `.payment_failed`, snapshot or thin (`v1.` prefix). Thin: fetches the PaymentIntent from Stripe. Idempotent insert with the service role. Logs one JSON line per delivery.","x":1560,"y":1400,"width":780,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"donations","type":"text","text":"## Table  donations\nid, user_id (-> auth.users), amount (cents), stripe_payment_intent_id (unique), status (`succeeded` | `failed`), created_at.\nUsers can SELECT only their own rows. Nobody inserts from the browser; only the webhook (service role) writes.","x":1560,"y":1790,"width":780,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"secrets","type":"text","text":"## Edge Function secrets\n`STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (+ `DOG_API_KEY` for the practice functions). Only in Supabase. Never in the repo or the browser.","x":1560,"y":2050,"width":780,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## How to read this map\nArrows follow the data. **Cyan** = pages, **green** = client data layer, **purple** = Supabase, **orange** = external services, **red** = secrets.\nAlso unused by the app: practice functions `hello-world`, `multiply-numbers`, `dog-picture`.","x":2560,"y":0,"width":440,"height":220},
		{"id":"pokeext","type":"text","text":"## PokeAPI  pokeapi.co\n`GET /api/v2/pokemon/{1-151}`: name + front_default sprite.","x":2560,"y":760,"width":440,"height":130,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"stripe","type":"text","text":"## Stripe API (test mode)\nCreates PaymentIntents, takes the card payment, then sends signed webhook events (thin payload) to stripe-webhook.\nTest cards: 4242 4242 4242 4242 (succeeds), 4000 0000 0000 0002 (declined).","x":2560,"y":1240,"width":440,"height":250,"color":"2"}
	],
